121
00:09:16,430 --> 00:09:19,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It is not meant for the likes of humans!</font>

122
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:23,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have to get stronger, no matter what!</font>

123
