126
00:10:27,830 --> 00:10:30,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Got ya!</font>

127
00:11:06,910 --> 00:11:09,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Old-timer!</font>

128
00:11:40,070 --> 00:11:41,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Old-timer!</font>

129
