<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What're you're doing, you old geezer?!</font>

130
00:11:52,180 --> 00:11:55,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let go of him.</font>

131
00:11:57,090 --> 00:12:02,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you do, I will help you up and reveal
