132
00:12:02,230 --> 00:12:05,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You can't be serious!</font>

133
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:08,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You aren't the Old-timer!</font>

134
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let go of him.</font>

135
00:12:11,940 --> 00:12:13,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No!</font>

136
00:12:29,890 --> 00:12:33,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You freak! Knock it off!</font>

137
00:12:36,590 --> 00:12:38,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let go of him!</font>

138
00:12:40,570 --> 00:12:42,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Never!</font>

139
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:07,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I <i>will not</i> let go of him!</font>

140
00:13:09,190 --> 00:13:12,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son Goku!</font>

141
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:55,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's going on?!</font>

142
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:15,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What happened?</font>

143
00:14:36,750 --> 00:14:39,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you the Darkness?!</font>

144
00:14:41,750 --> 00:14:43,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I won't lose!</font>

145
00:14:43,550 --> 00:14:49,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I award you the Super Sacred Water.</font>

146
00:14:49,730 --> 00:14:51,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son! There!</font>

147
00:14:54,010 --> 00:14:59,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}"Sacred"</font>

148
00:14:56,730 --> 00:14:59,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is the Super Sacred Water?</font>

149
00:14:59,540 --> 00:15:04,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The Super Sacred Water is a powerful poison.</font>

150
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:12,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you do not possess great
strength, mind, and vitality,</font>

151
00:15:12,550 --> 00:15:15,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">you will die an instant death.</font>

152
00:15:17,220 --> 00:15:20,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Poison? Not good...</font>

153
00:15:20,460 --> 00:15:24,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But I'll get stronger if I drink it, right?</font>

154
00:15:24,930 --> 00:15:28,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I do not know.</font>

155
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:29,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh?</font>

156
00:15:29,130 --> 00:15:35,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The Super Sacred Water
unlocks all of the power</font>

157
00:15:35,710 --> 00:15:39,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">hidden inside whoever should drink it.</font>

158
00:15:39,910 --> 00:15:52,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you possess no hidden power, drinking
it will bring about no change at all.</font>

159
00:15:52,260 --> 00:15:57,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So, uh, exactly how many
people have drunk it so far?</font>

160
00:15:57,660 --> 00:16:01,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fourteen.</font>

161
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:04,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And how many survived?</font>

162
00:16:06,040 --> 00:16:09,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Five? Three?</font>

163
00:16:09,010 --> 00:16:13,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">None.</font>

164
00:16:14,810 --> 00:16:16,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">None?!</font>

165
00:16:16,350 --> 00:16:18,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't be stupid!</font>

166
00:16:18,220 --> 00:16:24,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If no one's survived, then how do
you know it unlocks hidden power?!</font>

167
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:27,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's probably just ordinary poison!</font>

168
00:16:29,230 --> 00:16:31,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll drink it!</font>

169
00:16:31,630 --> 00:16:33,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you out of your mind?!</font>

170
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:37,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's not courage, it's stupidity!</font>

171
00:16:37,340 --> 00:16:39,300
